@startuml
title UC-08 - Provision Infrastructure and Application Resources
autonumber
actor "UC-06 / UC-07" as Caller
control ResourceProvisioningService as Service
control ActiveResourceResolver as ActiveResolver
control OutputBindingResolver as BindingResolver
control ExecutorRegistry as Registry
boundary ResourceExecutor as Executor
control ConnectionCredentialResolver as Credentials
control OutputContractValidator as Validator
database ActiveResourceRepository as ResourceRepo
database DeploymentResourceRepository as DeploymentResourceRepo

Caller -> Service: Provision(request) [MS-01]
note over Caller, Service
Container CPU/memory requests/limits stay in the workload module.
UC-06 WorkloadRenderer applies them after Provision returns (BR-06).
end note
loop Each provider-first batch [MS-09]
  loop Each resource node
    Service -> ActiveResolver: Resolve(descriptor, scope) [MS-02]
    ActiveResolver -> ResourceRepo: FindByLogicalIdentity()
    ResourceRepo --> ActiveResolver: ActiveResource or none
    ActiveResolver --> Service: Existing state
    Service -> BindingResolver: ResolveInputs(node, completedOutputs) [MS-03]
    BindingResolver --> Service: Resolved inputs
    Service -> Service: Validate target Definition connection equals Environment binding [BR-07]
    Service -> Registry: Resolve(driverType) [MS-04]
    Registry --> Service: ResourceExecutor
    Service -> Executor: Provision(resource, inputs, priorState) [MS-05]
    Executor -> Credentials: Resolve selected Connection when credential-backed
    Credentials --> Executor: private invocation credential + cleanup
    Executor --> Service: ExecutionResult(safe state/outputs, opaque target)
    Service -> Validator: Validate(resourceType, outputs) [MS-06]
    Validator --> Service: valid
    Service -> ResourceRepo: UpsertReady(activeResource) <<short transaction>> [MS-07]
    Service -> DeploymentResourceRepo: MarkReady(deployment, node) <<same transaction>>
    Service -> Service: completedOutputs[node] = outputs [MS-08]
  end
end
Service --> Caller: ProvisionResult [MS-10]

note over Service
Workload renderer Definitions are not provision batches.
UC-06 renders after these outputs exist; score-k8s cannot recreate infrastructure.
end note
@enduml
